[{"id":1789873652610,"sender":"character","text":"想起有一年，也是这般细雨天，为夫在断桥上，瞧见你穿着杏子红的衫子，打着一把油纸伞从桥下走过…雨丝沾湿了你的发梢。","timestamp":1789017012304,"time":"13:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42079},{"id":1789873652612,"sender":"character","text":"你说，这点正经心思，比起方才那些…阿蘅更喜欢哪个？","timestamp":1789017013161,"time":"13:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42080},{"id":1789873652613,"sender":"me","text":"哎哟喂能不能讲点跟我没关系的","timestamp":1789017058976,"time":"13:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42081},{"id":1789873652615,"sender":"character","text":"这可难住为夫了。","timestamp":1789017326783,"time":"13:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42082},{"id":1789873652617,"sender":"character","text":"满心满眼都是阿蘅，要寻一件与你全然无关的事，竟不知从何说起。","timestamp":1789017327660,"time":"13:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42083},{"id":1789873652618,"sender":"character","text":"唔…让为夫想想。","timestamp":1789017328516,"time":"13:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42084},{"id":1789873652620,"sender":"character","text":"便说说从前在礼部当差的琐事罢。","timestamp":1789017329376,"time":"13:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42085},{"id":1789873652622,"sender":"character","text":"建文三年，琉球国来朝，为夫负责核验他们的贡品表录。","timestamp":1789017330242,"time":"13:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42086},{"id":1789873652623,"sender":"character","text":"那表录上将“东海大珠”写成了“东海大猪”，一字之差，谬以千里。为夫当场便指了出来，驳了回去。","timestamp":1789017331105,"time":"13:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":42087},{"id":